SUMMARY:Tulip Day Festival
DESCRIPTION:This is an annual event to celebrate the liberation of Holland in WWII.  Our area has a number of people with Dutch heritage\, some of whom will share their stories at this event.  There is a BBQ\, cake\, artwork by the local high school\, music and often airforce fly overs.
URL:https://gardenontario.org/event/tulip-day-festival/
CATEGORIES:Community Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://gardenontario.org/wp-content/uploads/SGC-2026-Tulip-Fest-poster-let-size-v3_Page_2.jpeg
